      "en": "UNIQUE MECHANIC: Min Min's left stick controls her left Dragon ARM independently of her right ARM. Tilt the left stick to angle the Dragon ARM up or down. At max charge, the Dragon ARM fires a laser beam dealing bonus damage. This is the core of Min Min's spacing game — the left ARM always attacks with the Dragon regardless of ARMS Change.",
